# Walter Buildkite files

These files describe Walter's Buildkite pipeline: `pipeline.yml` (the real,
credential-free validation graph, building `//apps/walter/...` under
`--config=ci`), `upload-pipeline.sh` (how the pipeline's stored bootstrap gets
to `pipeline.yml`), and `provider-settings.json` (every automatic provider
trigger disabled until this scaffold is reviewed).

`bootstrap.yml` is this document's own copy of the pipeline's intended stored
bootstrap (`buildkite.pipeline.bootstrap.gate` compares the two structurally,
as YAML, not byte for byte). Paste it into the pipeline's Settings -> Steps
page by hand to replace the frozen upload bootstrap the pipeline was created
with, then re-run this document -- the gate reads `Compute` once they agree.

Triggers stay disabled until this scaffold has been reviewed and the pipeline
has run at least once with real content.
